6:6-6:7 error indicator-not-binary `i`
  | Indicator variable 'i' of constraint 'ind' is not binary
  | CPLEX, Gurobi and HiGHS require an indicator variable to be binary. Declare it in the Binary section.
  = 6:1 `ind`: uses it as an indicator
