8:1-8:3 warning sos-duplicate-weights `s1`
  | SOS 's1' gives 'x' and 'y' the same weight 1
  | The order of members is defined by their weights, so equal weights leave it undefined. CPLEX rejects this.
  data {"category":"structural","certainty":"proven"}
9:1-9:3 information sos-trivial `s2`
  | S2 set 's2' has 2 member(s) and is always satisfied
  | An SOS1 needs at least two members and an SOS2 at least three to restrict anything.
